//
// The model's one ELF (aie2_llama.py: the decode and the prefill) at its 16
// layers compiles, wherever run_llama.lit runs; no dispatch and no weights. Its pinned memtiles
// (aie2_decode.MemtilePins) are fullest, and its placement differs, at the
// layer count only the nightly runs.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, xrt_python_bindings, xrt_python_ctrl_scratchpad_bo
//
// RUN: %python %S/aie2_llama.py --n-layers 16 --full-elf-path %t.elf
